        {"t": "h1", "text": "Day 7 — Microservices, as a person who has to operate them"},
        {"t": "p", "text": "Outcome: you can defend a service boundary, a message contract, and a failure, and you can also defend keeping one deployable when the team and the domain are not ready to split."},
